OS volume label for that drive}\cell\row\pard \trowd\trql\trleft63\ltrrow\trkeep\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadft3\clpadt108\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx3515\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadft3\clpadt108\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx6968\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadft3\clpadt108\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx10421\pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\intbl\sl240\slmult1\sb0\sa20{\loch
/mnt/e}\cell\pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\intbl\sl240\slmult1\sb0\sa20{\loch
